Zero point energy                ...      0.02650338 Eh      16.63 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00032062 Eh       0.20 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
